      "message": "feat(infra): Pigsty DB integration — rootless PG17 appliance + Supabase evacuation restore kit\n\n- conf/: canonical pigsty-tuning.conf (cron.use_background_workers=on for the\n  no-IPv4-localhost sandbox, wal_level=logical for supabase_realtime) + pg_hba\n- bin/: pg-start/stop/restart/status + env.sh (PIGSTY_ROOT-overridable)\n- bootstrap/: 01 rootless PG17 from Debian debs, 02 pgmq/pg_net/supabase_vault\n  builds, 03 restore (dump or sql) with live-learned post-fixes, 04 manifest\n  row-count verify\n- smoke.sh: 13-point cluster health check\n- APP-INTEGRATION.md: edge DB_URL switch + client-constants A/B runbook\n- RESTORE-REPORT-20260920.md: 264-table diff (256 exact, 8 forward-drift on\n  hot tables), storage 1831/1831, cron fix record",
